{
  "_about": "Which exchange rate applies to an amount on a given date (ForeignExchangeRate). The rule: the company's own rate for that pair of currencies, the latest one dated on or before the day; a rate dated later does not count yet; another company's or another pair's rates never count; with no rate at all the amount is taken at 1 (and the reports warn about it). Rates on file for company 1: USD→EGP 30 from 2024-01-01, 48 from 2024-03-06, 50 from 2025-01-01; EURO→EGP 52 from 2024-06-01. Company 2: USD→EGP 99 from 2024-01-01. Worked out by hand.",
